  "question": "Where can I find a hospital that fall inside a 110 kilometers boundary to the northeast of Sloth Encounters, Hauppauge, NY?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.210029 40.824517)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-73.210029 40.824517)',4326)::geography, 110000)\nAND amenity = 'hospital'\nAND degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 22.5 AND 67.5;\n",
